The MIT License above covers only the original work in this repository: the
Traditional Chinese translation text, the font/text/DDX/BOK/release tooling
under `tools/`, build scripts, tests, and documentation.

It does NOT grant any rights to third-party material, namely:

- *Betrayal at Krondor* itself -- its game code, data, artwork, audio, and
  text -- which remains the property of its original copyright holders
  (Dynamix / Sierra and their successors). This project is an unofficial,
  non-commercial fan translation and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
  sponsored by them.
- The reverse-engineered C source tree vendored under `upstream/` (from
  [`canassa/betrayal-at-krondor`](https://github.com/canassa/betrayal-at-krondor)),
  which carries its own MIT license for that project's original work, subject
  to the same third-party disclaimer -- see `upstream/betrayal-at-krondor/LICENSE`.

Consistent with this, this project never distributes original game assets or
a compiled `KRONDOR.EXE`. Release artifacts under `dist/release_v100_zh/`
(see `tools/release/`) ship only a binary diff patch plus newly-authored
translated resource files, meant to be applied by end users to their own
legally obtained copy of the game -- see `README.md` and
`dist/release_v100_zh/README_安裝說明.txt` for details.
